\section*{1. Compression of the original equation}

Write the equation in the compact form
\begin{equation}\label{eq:original}
 y^2=(12x+7+L_1k+L_0)^2+\frac{P(k)}{12x+7},
\end{equation}
where
\[
P(k)=C_3k^3+C_2k^2+C_1k+C_0.
\]
The constants from the prompt are:
